  "description": "Every pod / server of your application registers itself to ConnectivityProbe Monitor with an app key, pulls its connection list, tests every connection (TCP) from inside and reports back, together with the application version, build id and Kubernetes cluster. Exact pod counts and per-pod results. One line to start, no endpoints, no dependencies. Works on .NET Core 2.0+, .NET 5-10 and .NET Framework 4.6.2+ (ASP.NET Core, IIS, workers, console apps).",
